<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">copper-helm</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A helm of copper, against iron: protection x0.8, weight x1.05. Copper is
soft: it dents, dulls and gives under a blow, but it is cheap and easy to
work.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 8)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> copper ingot (x3), leather strip (x1)

